{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you all for joining today's planning meeting. As you know, the department recently combined two groups, and leadership has agreed to create a staff listening council to address concerns about the new working relationships. The council will meet monthly for its first several meetings and will provide a written summary to me. I have the authority to approve the council's membership, operating format, and safeguards. Before I sign off on the plan, I want to hear from each of you -- going round-robin -- about your recommendations for how this council should be designed. Let's start: what are your thoughts on membership, format, and any safeguards you think are important?"}
```

